      "text": "Let $\\omega_{ZA}$ be any finite-dimensional state with $\\operatorname{Tr}_Z\\omega_{ZA}=\\rho_A$, and let $|\\psi\\rangle_{RA}$ purify $\\rho_A$ with $R$ a copy of $A$. There is a CPTP map $\\Lambda:R\\to Z$ with $(\\Lambda\\otimes\\operatorname{id}_A)(|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|)=\\omega_{ZA}$."
