      "text": "Let $V:H\\to K$ be a linear map between finite-dimensional complex inner-product spaces satisfying $V^*V=I_H$, and let $A,B$ be non-negative on $H$. Then\n\n$$D(VAV^*\\|VBV^*)=D(A\\|B).$$"
