      "def-qa-35-finite-probability-entropy-and-stochastic-matrices",
      "thm-natural-logarithm-laws"
    ],
    "public_export": {
      "section": "Statement",
      "text": "For finite $X,Y,Z$ with a joint pmf,\n\n$$H(X,Y|Z)=H(X|Z)+H(Y|X,Z),$$\n\nand\n\n$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z).$$\n\nIn particular, $I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X)$. All terms are finite."
    },
    "source_packet": "research/non-ml-math-remaining-81-2026-10-18-owner-step2-qre-resolution/batch24-owner-addendum"
  },
  {
    "id": "lem-it-operator-jensen-negative-log",
    "target": "items/lem-it-operator-jensen-negative-log.md",
